{
  "config_version": "chd-ct-nomask-v1",
  "_comment": "Profile chd_ct_nomask_v1: chd_ct_v1 with no segmentation of any kind, for the 3d arm (CT only, the no-mask control of the 3d_seg arm). It is chd_ct_v1 with the segmentation section and the five tools that need it (slicer-mcp SEG_TOOLS: set_segment_visibility, set_segment_opacity, set_3d_content, set_slice_outlines, center_on_segments) removed; every other value, presets.xml and report.py are chd_ct_v1's. Without a segmentation section the server resets with no shells and the state has no segments.",
